---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Ideas & Explorations — Vasile Grafu" description="Areas I keep researching and prototyping: applied AI and AI-assisted engineering practice.">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Ideas & Explorations</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
    Curiosity doesn’t stop when I leave the office. These are the areas I keep researching,
    prototyping, and thinking about — because the problems are fascinating and the field moves
    fast.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-8 space-y-6">
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Applied AI for enterprises</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        Agentic assistants grounded in a company’s own data — the architecture I build at scale
        today. I keep exploring what makes multi-agent orchestration, RAG pipelines, and tool
        integration actually work in production, beyond the demos.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">AI-assisted engineering practice</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        I use AI tools in every aspect of my work and lead teams through that transition. How
        engineering organizations evolve their craft around these tools is one of the most
        interesting open questions in our field right now.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/40 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900 p-6">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Thinking about the same problems?</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
      I enjoy comparing notes with people exploring these areas.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/contact/"
      class="mt-4 inline-block rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-white font-medium hover:bg-indigo-700"
    >
      Say hello
    </a>
  </div>
</Base>
